{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19940","headline":"石淙 四 · 孟郊","name":"石淙 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朔水刀劒利，秋石琼瑶鲜。\n鱼龙气不腥，潭洞状更妍。\n磴雪入呀谷，掬星洒遥天。\n声忙不及韵，势疾多断涟。\n输去虽有恨，躁气一何颠。\n蜿蜒相缠掣，荦确亦回旋。\n黑草濯铁发，白苔浮冰钱。\n具生此云遥，非德不可甄。\n何况被犀士，制之空以权。\n始知静刚猛，文教从来先。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19940.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19940","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}